fault-network-rule-readback-failed = Network configuration failed. Check installation files and network diagnostics, then run network repair again.
fault-network-rule-remove-failed = Network configuration failed. Check installation files and network diagnostics, then run network repair again.
fault-network-operation-required = Network configuration failed. Check installation files and network diagnostics, then run network repair again.
fault-network-operation-invalid = Network configuration failed. Check installation files and network diagnostics, then run network repair again.
fault-network-argument-invalid = Network configuration failed. Check installation files and network diagnostics, then run network repair again.
fault-network-uac-cancelled = Network configuration authorization was canceled. Retry and approve the system prompt when configuration is needed.
fault-incompatible-version = Protocol versions are incompatible. Use one complete installation package.
fault-playback-blocked = Playback authorization is disabled. Check output authorization or contact the room administrator.
fault-already-active = The device already has an active session. Refresh to view it.
fault-idempotency-conflict = This request identifier was used for another action. Refresh and try again.
fault-snapshot-required = An updated room snapshot is required. Refresh and try again.
fault-busy = Room control is busy. Try again shortly.
fault-command-id-reused = This action identifier was used for another action. Refresh and try again.
fault-invalid-command = The action is invalid. Check versions and settings, then try again.
fault-invalid-command-id = The action identifier is invalid. Refresh and try again.
fault-invalid-gain = The gain value is invalid. Check the gain settings.
fault-invalid-receiver-count = The AirPlay receiver count is invalid. Choose 1–4 receivers.
fault-invalid-receiver-name = The AirPlay receiver name is invalid. Check its length, characters, and duplicate names.
fault-invalid-source-alias = The source alias is invalid. Check its length and characters.
fault-profile-unavailable = The AirPlay profile is unavailable. Check the complete data directory and diagnostics.
fault-profile-write-failed = The AirPlay profile could not be saved. Check directory permissions and disk space, then try again.
fault-receiver-disabled = The AirPlay receiver is disabled. Enable it and try again.
fault-receiver-unknown = The AirPlay receiver no longer exists. Refresh the receiver list.
fault-source-unknown = The source no longer exists. Refresh the source list.

fault-profile-durability-unconfirmed = Settings commit is unconfirmed. Refresh or retry to finish recovery.
fault-configuration-recovery-required = Settings need recovery. Refresh or retry; playback remains stopped.

fault-output-object-replaced = This output binding was replaced. Refresh before changing it.

fault-resource-owned-by-other-instance = Another background instance owns this virtual output. Stop it there first.

fault-local-feedback-loop = Capture and the local room use the same endpoint. Choose different devices.

fault-local-feedback-check-unavailable = The local audio path could not be verified. Refresh network and devices, then retry.
